 playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/e33233c03b5b54622fbd33f2e1be7bb3.poster.avif?t=1756898288\" width=616 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/e33233c03b5b54622fbd33f2e1be7bb3.webm?t=1756898288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/extras/e33233c03b5b54622fbd33f2e1be7bb3.mp4?t=1756898288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique cards and mechanics and their turn order can differ each run. Adjust their role and build accordingly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cards and events can be discovered depending on the party composition leading to new challenges and rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More than a node map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way forward isn't as simple as you might think. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your  royal airship, The Helmholtz, not only between different procedurally generated nodes but also between different islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islands have unique traits and environments that may help or hinder your plans\u00a0to reach the eye of the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an endlessly replayable sequence of sky islands, as they are swirled into a new formation each run, leading to new revelations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble up to 20 different combinations of characters for your party and enjoy endlessly different deckbuilding approaches with hundreds of cards to experiment with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a new dynamic turn-based combat system leading to unexpected advantages and combos when resonating with your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through different island environments that bring their own challenges and rewards each run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and choose party-enhancing artifacts or character-specific gadgets and uncover different tactics with new cards and encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rich lore to piece the world together and learn more about each character</p></li></ul>","developers":["Resonarc"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938910/bcc773b2363a55c5f1a1f80fd40e119b9d5f0eff/header.jpg?t=1756898288","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257186104,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186104/movie480.mp4?t=1756473779","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186104/movie_max.mp4?t=1756473779"},"name":"Short Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186104/ad0c086d179dcafbcc7f49da4215d41c047052ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756473779","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186104/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756473779","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186104/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756473779"}}],"name":"Against All Skies","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1gb VRAM, OpenGL 3.0 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Resonarc"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasi